# Classes
:Flower a owl:Class.
:Butterfly a owl:Class.
:Image a owl:Class.
:Book a owl:Class.
:Ontology a owl:Class.
:Validation a owl:Class.
:OntologyDevelopmentProject a owl:Class.
:DomainExpert a owl:Class.

# Object Properties
:hasColor a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasType a owl:ObjectProperty.
